

### `Calender` (Date Dimension)
Generates a continuous daily calendar spanning `2021-01-01` to `2026-12-31` with quarterly helper columns to link all quarterly GASTAT and GOSI fact tables cleanly.

```dax
Calender = CALENDAR(DATE(2021, 1, 1), DATE(2026, 12, 31))

Year = YEAR(Calender[Date])

Quarter Number = QUARTER(Calender[Date])

Quarter Lable = "Q" & QUARTER(Calender[Date]) & " " & YEAR(Calender[Date])

Quarter Start = 
DATE(
    YEAR(Calender[Date]),
    (QUARTER(Calender[Date]) - 1) * 3 + 1,
    1
)

** (Tip: Sort Quarter Lable by Quarter Start so chronological x-axes render in proper order rather than alphabetically.)

## Gender & Nationality (Disconnected Slicer Parameter Table)
A custom DATATABLE used to drive unified nationality and gender filtering across wide-format fact tables via SWITCH measures.

Gender & Nationality = DATATABLE(
    "Nationality", STRING,
    "Gender", STRING,
    "Combined", STRING,
    {
        {"سعوديون",     "ذكور",   "سعوديون - ذكور"},
        {"سعوديون",     "إناث",   "سعوديون - إناث"},
        {"سعوديون",     "إجمالي", "سعوديون - إجمالي"},
        {"غير سعوديين", "ذكور",   "غير سعوديين - ذكور"},
        {"غير سعوديين", "إناث",   "غير سعوديين - إناث"},
        {"غير سعوديين", "إجمالي", "غير سعوديين - إجمالي"},
        {"الكل",        "الكل",   "الإجمالي - الكل"}
    }
)
